@authorizationToken = 172512415394c21466ef208e0a7410dc877d4180fc1e33d901bbda21c6a85750

### GET /products — lista todos los productos
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

###

### GET /products/:id — obtiene un producto por id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/6a3a7b3a7069f8d6f38a1956
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

###

### GET /products/category/:category — obtiene productos por categoría
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/category/gpu
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

###

### POST /products — crea un nuevo producto
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ryzen 7 9700x",
    "brand": "AMD",
    "price": 516000,
    "category": "cpu",
    "stock": 1
}

###

### DELETE /products/:id — elimina un producto
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/products/6a3c45cc196ab965613daca4
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}

###

### PATCH /products/:id — modifica un producto
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/products/6a3a7b3a7069f8d6f38a1956
Authorization: Bearer {{authorizationToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "stock": 5
}
